 probably already know, she is a half succubus half oni girl who comes from the countryside. Animals feel very comfortable with her. Normally extremely timid and shy but once her succubus blood awakens then she personality is the complete opposite, very assertive, flirty and lewd.\nFeel free to draw her however you wish. I look forward to your work!\n\nTiona: https://photos.app.goo.gl/LETe7irs1cRXcwW9A", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kashikina/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/bed397d0/uploads/origins/103e582c-dfdd-40d0-878b-c703c025451e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e9c372985fbb7c22752dcd5e852094d6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bed397d0/uploads/origins/103e582c-dfdd-40d0-878b-c703c025451e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e9c372985fbb7c22752dcd5e852094d6, https://si.imgix.net/bed397d0/uploads/origins/103e582c-dfdd-40d0-878b-c703c025451e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=883b1fdcd5c742635b8cb0cc312788db 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bed397d0/uploads/origins/103e582c-dfdd-40d0-878b-c703c025451e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1b38903fffe92bf9dc2b2a587802dd4f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは\n\nうちの子でリクエストをお送りします。\nキラキラしたものとして、コジマ粒子の煌めき。\n(コジマ粒子とは、謎の淡い緑に輝く粒子)\n食べ物を描いて頂ける場合は苺のタルト。\n服装等はお任せ、雰囲気としては胡散臭い感じでお願いします。\n\nご検討いただければ幸いです。\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/0e2kj3r5jkfi9hchvainf/h?rlkey=ssst3lyd8at1g14ulcdc5h1fe&dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kashikina/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/27e323a2/uploads/origins/fe50dbda-1395-4270-98aa-2099e548cdaf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a33e72c1a6b4d40c0688dc7507ad7c4f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/27e323a2/uploads/origins/fe50dbda-1395-4270-98aa-2099e548cdaf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=w